#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the multi‑engine profit collection system that
#    consolidates all ARKA engine profits into a unified packet for the
#    Lux Profit Allocator.
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    • Registers profit‑producing engines
#    • Ingests profit from each engine
#    • Applies stochastic smoothing to reduce volatility
#    • Consolidates all profits into a single packet
#    • Stores historical aggregation packets
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    register_source(name)
#       → Registers an engine as a profit source.
#
#    ingest(engine, amount)
#       → Adds profit from a specific engine.
#
#    consolidate()
#       → Produces unified profit packet for allocation.
#
#    get_history()
#       → Returns all past aggregation packets.
